OL,3,GNEWSAHonouring local heroes who make a
OL,4,Adifference
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople who make life better for others
OL,7,Fhave been honoured at this year's BBC
OL,8,FRadio Leeds Make a Difference Awards.
OL,10,FThe awards were set up during the Covid
OL,11,Fpandemic to recognise and celebrate our
OL,12,Funsung heroes.
OL,14,FThis year's winners included a kind and
OL,15,Fcourageous cub, an Everest-scaling
OL,16,Ffundraiser and a domestic abuse
OL,17,Fsurvivor empowering other women.
OL,19,FThe award ceremony took place at Royal
OL,20,FArmouries in Leeds and was hosted by
OL,21,FBBC Radio Leeds presenter Gayle
OL,22,FLofthouse.
